{"id":"9a0cecca-49c4-473f-8f21-4805921158f0","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:57:36.668Z","batchId":"onboarding_qwen3-8-flash-opencode-go_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack\">\n    <h1>Set up your workspace</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Three quick steps and you're in. We'll ask for your account details, a few preferences, and that's it.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stepper\" id=\"stepper\">\n      <div class=\"step\" data-step=\"1\"><span class=\"step-dot\">1</span><span class=\"step-label\">Account</span></div>\n      <div class=\"step-line\" data-line=\"1\"></div>\n      <div class=\"step\" data-step=\"2\"><span class=\"step-dot\">2</span><span class=\"step-label\">Preferences</span></div>\n      <div class=\"step-line\" data-line=\"2\"></div>\n      <div class=\"step\" data-step=\"3\"><span class=\"step-dot\">3</span><span class=\"step-label\">Done</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"wizard-alert\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" hidden>Please fix the highlighted fields before continuing.</div>\n\n    <!-- STEP 1: ACCOUNT -->\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"panel-1\">\n      <div class=\"stack\">\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Account details</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Use your work email — we'll send the login link there.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>Full name\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"f-name\" placeholder=\"e.g. Jordan Ellis\" autocomplete=\"name\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Work email\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"f-email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Password\n          <input type=\"password\" id=\"f-pass\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\" autocomplete=\"new-password\">\n          <span class=\"muted small\" id=\"pass-hint\">Use a mix of letters, numbers, and symbols.</span>\n        </label>\n        <label>Confirm password\n          <input type=\"password\" id=\"f-pass2\" placeholder=\"Repeat your password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Company\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"f-company\" placeholder=\"Acme Inc.\" autocomplete=\"organization\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Your role\n          <select id=\"f-role\">\n            <option value=\"\">Select a role…</option>\n            <option>Founder / Executive</option>\n            <option>Engineering</option>\n            <option>Product / Design</option>\n            <option>Operations</option>\n            <option>Marketing / Sales</option>\n            <option>Other</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f-invite\" checked>\n        Invite teammates via a shared sign-up link later\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- STEP 2: PREFERENCES -->\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"panel-2\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"stack\">\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Preferences</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">You can change all of this any time from Settings.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>Appearance\n          <select id=\"p-theme\">\n            <option>Match system</option>\n            <option>Light</option>\n            <option>Dark</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Language\n          <select id=\"p-lang\">\n            <option>English (US)</option>\n            <option>English (UK)</option>\n            <option>Español</option>\n            <option>Français</option>\n            <option>Deutsch</option>\n            <option>日本語</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Timezone\n          <select id=\"p-tz\">\n            <option>(GMT-08:00) Pacific Time</option>\n            <option selected>(GMT-05:00) Eastern Time</option>\n            <option>(GMT+00:00) London</option>\n            <option>(GMT+01:00) Berlin</option>\n            <option>(GMT+09:00) Tokyo</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Default dashboard\n          <select id=\"p-dash\">\n            <option>Overview</option>\n            <option>Projects</option>\n            <option>Reports</option>\n            <option>Activity feed</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3>Notifications</h3>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"p-digest\" checked> Weekly digest email <span class=\"muted small\">— Mondays, 9:00 AM</span></label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"p-mentions\" checked> Mentions &amp; replies <span class=\"muted small\">— only when someone @'s you</span></label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"p-marketing\"> Product news &amp; tips</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> Security alerts <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Required</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3>Default notification channel</h3>\n        <div class=\"row gap-lg\">\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p-chan\" value=\"Email\" checked> Email</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p-chan\" value=\"In-app\"> In-app</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p-chan\" value=\"Slack\"> Slack</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p-chan\" value=\"None\"> None</label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- STEP 3: DONE -->\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"panel-3\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"alert\">✓ Your workspace is ready. Welcome aboard — we've saved your preferences and sent a confirmation to <strong id=\"s-email\">your email</strong>.</div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Summary</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Double-check everything looks right. You can edit any of it from Settings.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <table>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>Name</td><td class=\"num\" id=\"s-name\">—</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Company</td><td class=\"num\" id=\"s-company\">—</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Role</td><td class=\"num\" id=\"s-role\">—</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Team invites</td><td class=\"num\" id=\"s-invite\">—</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <table>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>Appearance</td><td class=\"num\" id=\"s-theme\">—</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Language</td><td class=\"num\" id=\"s-lang\">—</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Timezone</td><td class=\"num\" id=\"s-tz\">—</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Notify via</td><td class=\"num\" id=\"s-chan\">—</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Notifications on</td><td class=\"num\" id=\"s-notif\">—</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3>What's next</h3>\n        <ol class=\"muted\">\n          <li>Create your first project, or import an existing one.</li>\n          <li>Invite teammates — you get 3 free seats on the Starter plan.</li>\n          <li>Connect your calendar to sync deadlines.</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"btn-back\">← Back</button>\n      <span class=\"muted small\" id=\"step-counter\">Step 1 of 3</span>\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"btn-next\">Continue →</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"muted small center\" style=\"width:100%\">By continuing you agree to our Terms &amp; Privacy Policy. This is step <span id=\"foot-step\">1</span> of the setup wizard.</p>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .stepper{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;width:100%}\n  .step{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5rem}\n  .step-dot{width:2.25rem;height:2.25rem;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;border:2px solid var(--border, #d4d4d8);color:var(--muted-foreground, #71717a);background:transparent;transition:all .2s}\n  .step-label{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted-foreground, #71717a)}\n  .step-line{flex:1;height:2px;background:var(--border, #d4d4d8);margin-top:1.1rem;min-width:1rem;transition:background .2s}\n  .step[data-state=\"active\"] .step-dot{border-color:var(--primary, #18181b);background:var(--primary, #18181b);color:var(--primary-foreground, #fafafa)}\n  .step[data-state=\"active\"] .step-label{font-weight:600;color:inherit}\n  .step[data-state=\"done\"] .step-dot{border-color:var(--primary, #18181b);color:var(--primary, #18181b)}\n  .step-line[data-state=\"done\"]{background:var(--primary, #18181b)}\n  .alert{margin-bottom:0}\n  #panel-3 .alert{display:flex;align-items:center}\n  table td:first-child{color:var(--muted-foreground, #71717a);font-size:.85rem}\n  .wizard-field-error{border-color:var(--destructive, #dc2626)}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var current = 1, total = 3;\n  var back = document.getElementById('btn-back');\n  var next = document.getElementById('btn-next');\n  var alert = document.getElementById('wizard-alert');\n  var counter = document.getElementById('step-counter');\n  var foot = document.getElementById('foot-step');\n\n  function state(n) {\n    if (n < current) return 'done';\n    if (n === current) return 'active';\n    return '';\n  }\n\n  function render() {\n    for (var i = 1; i <= total; i++) {\n      document.getElementById('panel-' + i).hidden = (i !== current);\n      var dot = document.querySelector('.step[data-step=\"' + i + '\"]');\n      dot.dataset.state = state(i);\n      dot.querySelector('.step-dot').textContent = (i < current) ? '✓' : i;\n      if (i < total) document.querySelector('.step-line[data-line=\"' + i + '\"]').dataset.state = (i < current) ? 'done' : '';\n    }\n    back.style.visibility = (current === 1) ? 'hidden' : 'visible';\n    next.textContent = current === 1 ? 'Continue →' : current === 2 ? 'Create my account ✓' : 'Go to dashboard →';\n    counter.textContent = 'Step ' + current + ' of ' + total;\n    foot.textContent = current;\n    if (current === 3) fillSummary();\n  }\n\n  function flagError(el) { el.classList.add('wizard-field-error'); el.addEventListener('input', function () { el.classList.remove('wizard-field-error'); }, { once: true }); }\n\n  function validateAccount() {\n    var ok = true;\n    alert.hidden = true;\n    var name = document.getElementById('f-name'), email = document.getElementById('f-email');\n    var pass = document.getElementById('f-pass'), pass2 = document.getElementById('f-pass2');\n    if (!name.value.trim()) { flagError(name); ok = false; }\n    if (!/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email.value)) { flagError(email); ok = false; }\n    if (pass.value.length < 8) { flagError(pass); ok = false; }\n    if (pass2.value !== pass.value || !pass2.value) { flagError(pass2); ok = false; }\n    if (!ok) alert.hidden = false;\n    return ok;\n  }\n\n  function fillSummary() {\n    var get = function (id) { return document.getElementById(id).value; };\n    document.getElementById('s-email').textContent = get('f-email') || 'your email';\n    document.getElementById('s-name').textContent = get('f-name') || '—';\n    document.getElementById('s-company').textContent = get('f-company') || '—';\n    document.getElementById('s-role').textContent = get('f-role') || '—';\n    document.getElementById('s-invite').textContent = document.getElementById('f-invite').checked ? 'Link enabled' : 'Skipped';\n    document.getElementById('s-theme').textContent = get('p-theme');\n    document.getElementById('s-lang').textContent = get('p-lang');\n    document.getElementById('s-tz').textContent = get('p-tz');\n    var chan = document.querySelector('input[name=\"p-chan\"]:checked');\n    document.getElementById('s-chan').textContent = chan ? chan.value : 'None';\n    var on = [];\n    if (document.getElementById('p-digest').checked) on.push('Digest');\n    if (document.getElementById('p-mentions').checked) on.push('Mentions');\n    if (document.getElementById('p-marketing').checked) on.push('News');\n    on.push('Security');\n    document.getElementById('s-notif').textContent = on.join(', ');\n  }\n\n  next.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (current === 2 && !validateAccount()) return;\n    if (current < total) { current++; render(); }\n    else { next.textContent = 'Opening dashboard…'; }\n  });\n\n  back.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (current > 1) { current--; alert.hidden = true; render(); }\n  });\n\n  render();\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[22013,"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n"],[22154,"  <div class=\"stack\">\n    <h1>Set up"],[22287," your workspace</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted"],[22418,"\">Three quick steps and you're in. We'll ask"],[22520," for your account details, a few preferences, and"],[22622," that's it.</p>\n  </div>\n\n"],[22786,"  <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stepper\""],[22908," id=\"stepper\">\n      <div class=\"step"],[23029,"\" data-step=\"1\"><span class=\"step-dot\"